    {
      "name": "run_command",
      "description": "Run a shell command in the project folder (tests, a build) and wait for it; timeout_seconds defaults to 120. With a session name, the working folder and exported variables (an activated virtualenv) carry over to later calls with that session, until two idle hours. For a server that keeps running, use start_process.",
